<v Joshuah Bearman>This is Sharon Roof. She's the client-- the woman with a cheating fiance. While most of the people playing roles in the fake case were actors or friends of Chris Butler, Sharon is interesting because she had actually hired Chris Butler and the PI Moms months earlier, to follow her real cheating fiancee, and they caught him. She'd been impressed by Chris, and thought he was a nice guy. He'd gotten the truth for her, after all.
<v Joshuah Bearman>这是莎伦·鲁夫。她是那位客户——那位有出轨未婚夫的女性。虽然大多数在虚假案件中扮演角色的都是演员或克里斯·巴特勒的朋友，但莎伦很有意思，因为她几个月前确实聘请过克里斯·巴特勒和“妈妈侦探”去跟踪她真正的出轨未婚夫，他们抓到了他。她对克里斯印象深刻，认为他是个好人。毕竟，他帮她查出了真相。

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:31.610
<v Joshuah Bearman>And then he convinced her to come and work for him. Sharon agreed, doing mostly office management, until one day, Chris took Sharon to lunch and told her about this big upcoming feature in Diablo magazine.
<v Joshuah Bearman>然后他劝她来为他工作。莎伦同意了，主要做办公室管理，直到有一天，克里斯带莎伦去吃午饭，并告诉她关于《迪亚布罗》杂志即将到来的大专题报道的事。

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:37.090
<v Sharon>And he asks me, he goes, are you comfortable? I'd like to use your story.
<v Sharon>他问我，他说，你感觉如何？我想用你的故事。

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:44.330
<v Joshuah Bearman>By "use her story," Chris meant he wanted to reenact her case. Sharon was skeptical at first, but eventually she agreed.
