00:13:44.330 --> 00:14:06.650
<v Sharon>So then we sat down, you know, all of us, in the conference room, going over, OK, so this is what's going to happen. And then he starts changing the story. And I pulled him aside. I said, Chris, why are you changing the story? And he said, well, it's not exciting enough. Your story isn't exciting enough, and I want to just make it more exciting.
<v Sharon>于是我们坐在一起，你知道，我们所有人，在会议室里，过了一遍：好的，那么接下来会发生什么。然后他开始修改故事。我把他拉到一边。我说，克里斯，你为什么要修改故事？他说，嗯，不够刺激。你的故事不够刺激，我想让它更刺激一点。

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:26.340
<v Sharon>So then everything started changing. So it's like, OK. Now we're play acting. And I really didn't feel comfortable with it. But then he said, you know, Sharon, think about all the women that you'd be helping. All these women that their husbands, their boyfriends cheat on them, and you know, blah, blah, blah. So I did. I went along with it.
<v Sharon>于是所有事情都开始改变了。所以就像是，好的。现在我们在演戏。我真的觉得不舒服。但他又说，你知道，莎伦，想想你将要帮助的所有女性。所有那些丈夫、男朋友背叛她们的女性，你知道，等等等等。所以我照做了。我顺从了。

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:31.210
<v Joshuah Bearman>But for the drama to work, Chris wanted Sharon to nail the emotional heart of the performance.
<v Joshuah Bearman>但为了让戏剧效果起作用，克里斯希望莎伦能把握住表演的情感核心。

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:58.560
<v Sharon>Chris told me-- he said, Sharon, he goes, just go back in time to when you came to me those couple months ago, when Michael was cheating on you. And that's where your head's at when you come in and talk to Peter. So that's exactly where my head was at. So those tears were real. Everything was real. It was like I was reliving the same conversation I had with Chris when I came to first meet him.
<v Sharon>克里斯告诉我——他说，莎伦，他说，回到几个月前你来找我的时候，当迈克尔背叛你的时候。当你进来和皮特谈话时，这就是你的心境。所以我当时的心境就是这样。所以那些眼泪是真的。一切都是真实的。就像我重温了第一次来见他时和克里斯的谈话。

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:13.450
<v Joshuah Bearman>And so there was Pete. An audience of one for Chris Butler's production, which only got more intricate as the day wore on, with an expanding cast of characters and plot-enhancing cameos. Such as this moment, when Pete and the Moms were approached by a car.
<v Joshuah Bearman>于是皮特就在那里。克里斯·巴特勒这场制作的唯一观众，随着一天的推移，这场制作变得更加错综复杂，有着不断扩大的角色阵容和增强情节的客串。比如这个时刻，皮特和妈妈们被一辆车拦住了。

