00:30:00.560 --> 00:30:01.850
<v Man>[UNINTELLIGIBLE] your hands up!
<v Man>举起手来！

00:30:01.850 --> 00:30:09.710
<v Joshuah Bearman>Oh yeah. And just to make this more interesting, Chris filmed the whole thing. Carl showed me the footage.
<v Joshuah Bearman>噢，是的。而且为了让这更有趣，克里斯把整个过程都录了下来。卡尔给我看了录像。

00:30:09.710 --> 00:30:10.780
<v Joshuah Bearman>Is that Norm?
<v Joshuah Bearman>那是诺姆吗？

