<v Carl Marino>That's Norm right there, yes.
<v Carl Marino>那就是诺姆，是的。

00:30:12.980 --> 00:30:16.310
<v Joshuah Bearman>Look at this poor kid. He looks like such a goof, on top of it.
<v Joshuah Bearman>看看这个可怜的孩子。他看起来真是个傻瓜，最重要的是。

00:30:16.310 --> 00:30:27.340
<v Carl Marino>Yeah. He was. And he's a kid. And his eyes were giant when he had those guns in his face, and he was terrified. Rightfully so. I mean, I would have been terrified if that was me.
